msgid "Ch48_BZ_75_grinch"
msgstr "Assault"

msgid "Ch48_BZ_75_grinch_descr"
msgstr ""
"The Assault is the perfect breakthrough vehicle, rushing to the center and "
"dealing huge amounts of damage with little concern for its own wellbeing. It"
" excels at disabling whole groups of enemies then taking them out one by one"
" with the help of boosting and ramming."

msgid "_152mm_AP_T_grinch"
msgstr "Paper Ball"

msgid "_152mm_AP_T_grinch_descr"
msgstr ""
"A standard gun with a heavy explosive paper ball that deals splash damage."
